  .page-top
    a.back-link(href='/') <svg class="compat-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 12H4m7-7-7 7 7 7"></path></svg> Back to the guide
    span.eyebrow THE STORY / LOC8R
  section.about-layout
    .about-title
      p.eyebrow GOOD WORK NEEDS A LITTLE SPACE
      h1 Anywhere<br>can be<br><em>your corner.</em>
      .about-stamp(aria-hidden='true') COFFEE<br>+ WIFI<br>+ YOU <svg class="compat-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"></path></svg>
    .about-copy
      p.large-copy Loc8r started with a simple idea: help people find a place to sit down and get a bit of work done.
      p Perhaps with coffee, cake, or a pint. A place with accessible wifi and room for your laptop. Somewhere outside the usual four walls.
      hr
      p.eyebrow A LEARNING PROJECT, REVISITED
      h2 A field guide<br><em>with a backstory.</em>
      p This project is based on <em>Getting MEAN</em> by Simon Holmes and Clive Harber. It retains the original Starcups location, opening hours, facilities, and sample reviews, with a new cartographic interface by Andres.
      p The pages are built from Pug templates and published as static HTML on GitHub Pages. Everything here is fictional: there is no location tracking, live business search, database, or saved review system.
      p OpenStreetMap provides an optional external map link, without an embedded map or API key. The animated route artwork is an illustration rather than a geographic map.
      a.button(href='/#places') Explore the sample place <span aria-hidden='true'><svg class="compat-arrow" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 19 19 5M5 5h14v14"></path></svg></span>
